The solution covers all the 3 projects , I have built an API cover all fuctionality then create client app with different views based on role.

You can watch the uploaded videos

Clone the project ,after cloning you will get web-api and clientapp.zip

1. Open the web-api ,then change the connection string to point to local mssql database and make sure the credentials are correct then run the migration :
update-database

2. Uzip the clientapp , open it with visual code then run npm i then run witn with ng serve -o . Make sure you have angular environment configured

Credentials :
1. Client : User : system , Password : User1
2. Client : User : admin , Password : Admin1
